OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with some patchy
OL,6,Flight rain. Cloud breaks through the
OL,7,Fday with sunny spells and any rain
OL,8,Fbecoming limited to coastal showers.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average. Breezy in
OL,10,Fplaces.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud breaking up through the
OL,13,Fevening with long clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping after midnight. Widespread
OL,15,Ffrost developing for rural areas with
OL,16,Fsome patchy mist and fog possible.
OL,17,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
